    "name": "What is OB/GYN Medical Malpractice Insurance?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "It’s specialized coverage for OB/GYNs protecting against lawsuits from medical errors, birth complications, or surgical mistakes. Essential due to high litigation risk in obstetrics and gynecology."
